### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### OpenConnect Config — Postman Collection Testing via Backend
### 
### This file demonstrates using your Postman collection format
### through the OpenConnect Config backend's passthrough endpoint
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@backendUrl = http://localhost:3002
@ocCoreUrl = http://10.0.142.4:7033/mpg/queueforwarding/

### Backend Health Check
GET {{backendUrl}}/api/health

###

### Test 1: Title Fetch (via passthrough)
### Forwards your Postman collection format to OC Core
POST {{backendUrl}}/api/oc-core/passthrough
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endpoint": "{{ocCoreUrl}}",
  "method": "GET",
  "body": {
    "meta_data": {
      "method": "POST",
      "trans_type": "title-fetch"
    },
    "body": {
      "TransactionAmount": "000000002000",
      "TransmissionDateAndTime": "0220104400",
      "stan": "218998",
      "Time": "104400",
      "Date": "0220",
      "FromBankIMD": "639357",
      "rrn": "182486216659",
      "Location": "Test Store",
      "City": "Karachi",
      "State": "Sindh",
      "ZipCode": "74200",
      "AgentName": "Bank Islamic",
      "AgentCity": "Remit Channel",
      "ADCLiteral": "Any Channel",
      "BankName": "Bank Islamic",
      "Country": "PK",
      "AccountNumberTo": "PK66MEZN00015401065442903",
      "ToBankIMD": "627873",
      "PAN": "0000000000000"
    }
  },
  "timeoutMs": 30000
}

###

